SUMMARY:[Computer Graphics & Visualization][Machine Learning] ACM SIGGRAPH 
 2027 - Conference
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: ACM SIGGRAPH Annual Conference\nWebsite: http
 s://s2027.siggraph.org/\nSource URL: https://s2027.siggraph.org/\nLocatio
 n: Anaheim\, California\, USA\nTopics: Computer Graphics & Visualization\
 , Machine Learning\, Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition\nSize: XXL\nSu
 bmission type: Technical papers / conference and ACM TOG tracks\nConfiden
 ce: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-28\nNotes: The 2027 site confir
 ms the Anaheim Convention Center\, Aug 8-12\, 2027. Its Technical Papers 
 page (updated 2026-09-30) gives Jan 21/28/29\, 2027 at 22:00 UTC\; the ol
 der Submit page still says TBA and no exact opening is published. The upl
 oad step is not a new paper route. Not SIGGRAPH Asia\; ranks refer to the
  conference\, not TOG. XXL is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Computer gra
 phics and interactive techniques\, centered on rendering\, geometric mode
 ling\, animation\, physical simulation\, imaging\, visualization\, and im
 mersive visual experiences. Generative AI and machine learning are releva
 nt when they advance visual computing\, such as neural rendering and lear
 ned animation. Technical papers use integrated conference and ACM TOG jou
 rnal tracks\; this profile does not describe SIGGRAPH Asia or all of AI.\
 nAdditional topics: Deep Representation Learning\, Human-AI Interaction &
  Deployment\nScope sources (2026): https://s2026.siggraph.org/program/tec
 hnical-papers/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
