 ics: Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition\, Deep Representation Learning
 \, Machine Learning\nSize: XXL\nSubmission type: Paper-based / OpenReview
 \nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-28\nNotes: As of 2026
 -10-28 the 2027 homepage header and Dates page give Sun Oct 3 to Thu Oct 
 7 (workshops/tutorials Oct 3-4\, main conference Oct 5-7) at the Hong Kon
 g Convention and Expo Center (HKCEC)\; the homepage venue paragraph confl
 icts\, still saying Oct 2-8. No 2027 call is published\; paper dates are 
